01:35:34.576 --> 01:35:35.436
Hlúpa líška.

01:35:35.916 --> 01:35:37.396
Vieš, že ma miluješ.

01:35:37.896 --> 01:35:38.816
Naozaj to viem?

01:35:39.816 --> 01:35:40.116
Áno.

01:35:40.976 --> 01:35:41.656
Áno, viem.

01:35:46.176 --> 01:35:56.226
